  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-02-24T15:10:24-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, February 24, 2024, 3:10 pm\">February 24, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>John Glass, long-time Guild member and past-President (2012-13), was elevated to ‘Honorary Member’ at the Guild’s Annual Meeting on November 18<sup>th</sup>, 2023.  John joined the Guild in 2002 and for many years was an artist at the seasonal Art-in-the-Park and still shows in the seasonal Art Gallery in Harwich Port.  More information on John’s oil paintings can be found at: johnglassfineart.com.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_6707\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-6707\" src=\"/media/archive/0390e1b40837f9671e469377fa002d44246d5a10af6e462080a040763e47ea47.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-6707\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">John Glass (left( receives Honorary Certificate from President Michael Ruden.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
